@startuml Grammarly Extension Flows
skinparam Handwritten false
skinparam Monospace false

actor User
participant "Web Page DOM" as WebPage
participant "Content Script\n(Grammarly-check.js)" as ContentScript
participant "Google Docs CS\n(Grammarly-gDocs.js)" as DocsScript
participant "Background SW\n(sw.js / Grammarly-bg.js)" as Background
participant "Side Panel UI\n(Grammarly-sidePanel.js)" as SidePanel
database "Local Storage / IndexedDB" as Storage
entity "Grammarly CAPI Server\n(capi.grammarly.com)" as CAPI
entity "Telemetry Services\n(f-log-extension.grammarly.io)" as Telemetry
entity "Auth Server\n(auth.grammarly.com)" as Auth
entity "Config Server\n(config.extension.grammarly.com)" as Config

== 1. Initialization and Configuration ==
Background -> Storage : Check isBGInitialized
Background -> Config : Get remote configurations / flags (gates/treatment)
Config --> Background : Returns feature configuration flags
Background -> Storage : Save configuration (feMetricsAlarms, feMetricsData)

== 2. User Authentication ==
User -> SidePanel : Clicks Sign In
SidePanel -> Background : socialAuth request
Background -> Auth : Authenticate credentials / session token
Auth --> Background : Return GrammarlyEnrollmentToken / sessionId
Background -> Storage : Save auth token and sessionId

== 3. Text Capture and Suggestions Flow ==
User -> WebPage : Types text / inputs content
WebPage -> ContentScript : On keydown / textchange events
ContentScript -> ContentScript : Parse & validate editable targets
ContentScript -> Background : sendMessage (extract document details / text delta)
Background -> CAPI : Establish WebSocket / HTTPS request (text context)
CAPI --> Background : Stream grammatical and style corrections
Background -> ContentScript : sendMessage (show corrections & suggestions)
ContentScript -> WebPage : Inject Grammarly button & highlight spelling overlays

== 4. Generative AI (Inkwell / Sidepanel) Flow ==
User -> SidePanel : Issues writing prompt / request
SidePanel -> Background : Message (run writing skill / generation)
Background -> CAPI : wss://capi.grammarly.com (Stream prompt request)
CAPI --> Background : Stream AI text response
Background -> SidePanel : Propagate streamed AI response
SidePanel -> User : Render suggestions / rewrite options

== 5. Telemetry and Analytics Flow ==
ContentScript -> Background : Send user behavior metrics
SidePanel -> Background : Send performance logs
Background -> Telemetry : navigator.sendBeacon() / fetch() (log / batch events)
Telemetry --> Background : Acknowledge ingestion (logv2 / batch/log)

@enduml
